    English strings. The neutral fallback culture for Humo.

    RULES (see CLAUDE.md):
      - Every user-facing string in the app lives here. Never hardcode a string
        in XAML or in a ViewModel.
      - Every key added here MUST be added to AppResources.es.resx in the SAME
